WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.132 --> 00:00:08.500
&gt;&gt; Laura: FRIGHTENING PROPOSALS

00:00:08.501 --> 00:00:10.068
EMERGING FROM A U.N. PANEL OVER

00:00:10.069 --> 00:00:11.936
THE WEEKENDMENT NOT ONLY DOES

00:00:11.937 --> 00:00:13.371
THE SO-CALLED UNITED NATIONS

00:00:13.372 --> 00:00:15.173
GLOBAL COMPACT FOR SAFE, ORDERLY

00:00:15.174 --> 00:00:17.976
AND REGULAR MIGRATION WANT TO

00:00:17.977 --> 00:00:19.277
MAKE IMMIGRATION A UNIVERSAL

00:00:19.278 --> 00:00:21.679
HUMAN RIGHT, THEY WANT TO MAKE

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.516
IT A CRIME FOR MEDIA OUTLETS TO

00:00:24.517 --> 00:00:27.118
ALLOW FOR CERTAIN TYPES OF

00:00:27.119 --> 00:00:28.887
CRITICISM AGAINST MIGRATION.

00:00:28.888 --> 00:00:29.621
WATCH.

00:00:29.622 --> 00:00:33.057
&gt;&gt; CRITICISM OF MIGRATION WILL

00:00:33.058 --> 00:00:36.060
BECOME A CRIMINAL OFFENSE, AND

00:00:36.061 --> 00:00:38.496
MEDIA OUTLETS -- AND THAT ALSO

00:00:38.497 --> 00:00:40.298
CONCERNS YOU -- TAGIVE ROOM TO

00:00:40.299 --> 00:00:42.500
CRITICISM OF MIGRATION CAN BE

00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:44.669
SHUT DOWN.

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:46.037
&gt;&gt; Laura: HERE NOW IS SOMEONE

00:00:46.038 --> 00:00:48.840
WHO KNOWS MORE ABOUT THIS THAN

00:00:48.841 --> 00:00:52.977
THE AVERAGE JOE, I WOULD SAY,

00:00:52.978 --> 00:00:56.281
THIS DIMINISHED E.U. TODAY IS

00:00:56.282 --> 00:01:00.518
NIGEL FARAGE, OF THE PREXIT

00:01:00.519 --> 00:01:03.354
MOVEMENT THAT RAISED IMMIGRATION

00:01:03.355 --> 00:01:05.290
DESTROYING THE FIBER OF THE

00:01:05.291 --> 00:01:06.858
U.K., THANKS FOR STAYING UP LATE

00:01:06.859 --> 00:01:07.425
FOR US.

00:01:07.426 --> 00:01:08.626
WE APPRECIATE IT.

00:01:08.627 --> 00:01:10.528
IS THERE A CHANCE THAT WITH THIS

00:01:10.529 --> 00:01:12.096
GLOBAL COMPACT ON MIGRATION THAT

00:01:12.097 --> 00:01:14.833
THIS ACTUALLY COULD COME TO PASS

00:01:14.834 --> 00:01:17.001
THAT THIS TYPE OF CRITICISM OF

00:01:17.002 --> 00:01:20.471
MIGRATION COULD BE CRIMINALIZED?

00:01:20.472 --> 00:01:24.042
&gt;&gt; YOU WERE QUITE RIGHT TO SAY

00:01:24.043 --> 00:01:26.778
THAT WHAT THE U.N. WANTS TO DO

00:01:26.779 --> 00:01:27.712
IS MAKE IMMIGRATION A HUMAN

00:01:27.713 --> 00:01:29.914
RIGHT, WHAT IT ALSO WANTS TO DO

00:01:29.915 --> 00:01:31.182
IS MAKE ILLEGAL IMMIGRATION

00:01:31.183 --> 00:01:33.351
LEGAL BY DEFINING A REFUGEE AS

00:01:33.352 --> 00:01:35.119
ANYBODY THAT WANTS TO MOVE

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:35.787
BETWEEN COUNTRIES.

00:01:35.788 --> 00:01:38.356
SO BASICALLY WHAT IT WANTS TO DO

00:01:38.357 --> 00:01:40.358
IS TO MAKE US ALL GLOBAL

00:01:40.359 --> 00:01:41.359
CITIZENS AND GOVERNMENTS ARE

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:42.660
GOING TO THIS NEXT WEEK.

00:01:42.661 --> 00:01:45.363
MANY WILL SIGN UP TO IT WITHOUT

00:01:45.364 --> 00:01:46.698
EVER CONSULTING THEIR OWN

00:01:46.699 --> 00:01:49.100
PEOPLE, BUT YOU ARE QUITE RIGHT.

00:01:49.101 --> 00:01:51.102
THE MOST WORRYING PART IS THE

00:01:51.103 --> 00:01:54.339
SECTION ON THE MEDIA WHERE IT

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:58.543
SAYS VERY CLEARLY THAT MEDIA

00:01:58.544 --> 00:02:02.013
OUTLETS WHO ARE INTOLERANT,

00:02:02.014 --> 00:02:05.283
CRITICAL, XENOPHOBIC OR RACIST

00:02:05.284 --> 00:02:08.019
IN THEIR CRITICISM OF MASS

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:09.254
MIGRATION -- AS SOON AS YOU

00:02:09.255 --> 00:02:12.257
START TO DEFINE PEOPLE LIKE THAT

00:02:12.258 --> 00:02:13.024
YOU'RE GETTING INTO TERRITORY

00:02:13.025 --> 00:02:15.860
WHERE PEOPLE CAN BE DEFINED AS

00:02:15.861 --> 00:02:17.228
COMMITTING HATE CRIMES.

00:02:17.229 --> 00:02:18.796
THEY WANT TO MAKE IT -- THEY

00:02:18.797 --> 00:02:21.199
ACTUALLY WANT TO MAKE IT ILLEGAL

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:23.968
TO CRITICIZE OPEN-DOOR

00:02:23.969 --> 00:02:24.402
IMMIGRATION.

00:02:24.403 --> 00:02:28.273
IS IT ACTUALLY GOING TO WORK?

00:02:28.274 --> 00:02:29.374
THANKFULLY, THE U.N. ITSELF

00:02:29.375 --> 00:02:32.176
DOESN'T HAVE LEGAL POWER, BUT --

00:02:32.177 --> 00:02:33.578
&gt;&gt; Laura: NIGEL, DOESN'T IT ALSO

00:02:33.579 --> 00:02:37.982
OPERATE AS KIND OF A FRAMEWORK

00:02:37.983 --> 00:02:38.716
FOR INTERNATIONAL HUMAN RIGHTS

00:02:38.717 --> 00:02:39.017
CASES?

00:02:39.018 --> 00:02:41.519
IT ENDS UP BEING A FRAMEWORK

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:42.353
THAT, UNDER A DIFFERENT SUPREME

00:02:42.354 --> 00:02:44.722
COURT IN THIS COUNTRY COULD BE

00:02:44.723 --> 00:02:45.123
REFERENCED?

00:02:45.124 --> 00:02:46.925
THERE ARE A LOT OF JUSTICES WHO

00:02:46.926 --> 00:02:48.660
BELIEVE THAT REFERENCING FOREIGN

00:02:48.661 --> 00:02:50.461
LAW IS OK WHICH, OF COURSE, IT'S

00:02:50.462 --> 00:02:52.096
NOT THE WAY IT'S DONE IN OUR

00:02:52.097 --> 00:02:55.233
COUNTRY -- SADLY, IT'S BEEN DONE

00:02:55.234 --> 00:02:57.635
IN THE PAST -- SO THAT'S THE

00:02:57.636 --> 00:02:58.002
PROBLEM.

00:02:58.003 --> 00:02:59.370
IT BECOMES ANOTHER INTERNATIONAL

00:02:59.371 --> 00:03:00.872
NORM AND CLIMATE CHANGE IS ONE

00:03:00.873 --> 00:03:01.306
THING.

00:03:01.307 --> 00:03:03.241
I'M NOT TALKING ABOUT CLIMATE

00:03:03.242 --> 00:03:05.743
CHANGE, BUT IN THIS CASE IT'S A

00:03:05.744 --> 00:03:07.545
NORM, SO IF YOU -- WE DO A LOT

00:03:07.546 --> 00:03:10.448
OF STUFF ON MIGRATION.

00:03:10.449 --> 00:03:12.183
YOU AND I HAVE TALKED ABOUT THE

00:03:12.184 --> 00:03:13.284
ILLEGAL IMMIGRATION ISSUE FOR

00:03:13.285 --> 00:03:14.585
YEARS SO TALKING ABOUT THE FACT

00:03:14.586 --> 00:03:18.456
THAT WE HAVE SO MANY ILLEGAL

00:03:18.457 --> 00:03:19.324
IMMIGRANTS ON SOCIAL WELFARE IN

00:03:19.325 --> 00:03:20.658
THE UNITED STATES, A SURVEY

00:03:20.659 --> 00:03:23.761
TODAY, ABOUT 61% ON SOME TYPE OF

00:03:23.762 --> 00:03:24.429
SOCIAL PROGRAM.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:26.931
THAT WOULD BE CONSIDERED,

00:03:26.932 --> 00:03:27.932
PERHAPS, HATEFUL.

00:03:27.933 --> 00:03:28.700
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:03:28.701 --> 00:03:30.401
HERE I AM IN LONDON.

00:03:30.402 --> 00:03:32.370
AS WE SPEAK, THERE ARE A

00:03:32.371 --> 00:03:34.405
THOUSAND POLICE OFFICERS IN

00:03:34.406 --> 00:03:35.807
LONDON WHO JUST INVESTIGATE HATE

00:03:35.808 --> 00:03:38.042
CRIME AND THE DEFINITIONS OF

00:03:38.043 --> 00:03:40.478
WHAT HATE CRIME GET BROADER AND

00:03:40.479 --> 00:03:41.312
BROADER.

00:03:41.313 --> 00:03:42.981
THIS IS AN ATTEMPT BY THE U.N.

00:03:42.982 --> 00:03:45.883
TO MAKE ANY CRITICISM OF MASS

00:03:45.884 --> 00:03:46.918
MIGRATION SOMETHING THAT SHOULD

00:03:46.919 --> 00:03:48.720
BE CONSIDERED CRIMINAL, AND

00:03:48.721 --> 00:03:51.723
EFFECTIVELY WHAT THEY'RE SAYING

00:03:51.724 --> 00:03:54.125
IS THEY WILL FAVOR MEDIA OUTLETS

00:03:54.126 --> 00:03:56.194
THAT PROMOTE THEIR IDEAS

00:03:56.195 --> 00:03:56.594
MATERIALLY.

00:03:56.595 --> 00:03:58.062
THEY'RE EVEN TALKING ABOUT

00:03:58.063 --> 00:04:01.265
FUNDING MEDIA OUTLETS THAT

00:04:01.266 --> 00:04:02.400
SUPPORT THEIR VIEW.

00:04:02.401 --> 00:04:03.101
I'M BEING SERIOUS.

00:04:03.102 --> 00:04:05.636
BELIEVE ME, I HAVE SEEN THIS

00:04:05.637 --> 00:04:08.106
MYSELF IN BRUSSELS BECAUSE THE

00:04:08.107 --> 00:04:09.240
EUROPEAN UNION -- THAT IS THE

00:04:09.241 --> 00:04:12.276
SORT OF PROTOTYPE FOR THE

00:04:12.277 --> 00:04:13.044
GLOBALISTS, AND THE EUROPEAN

00:04:13.045 --> 00:04:14.746
COMMISSION ACTUALLY GIVE MONEY

00:04:14.747 --> 00:04:17.348
TO MEDIA ORGANIZATIONS THAT

00:04:17.349 --> 00:04:19.984
PROMOTE THEIR VIEWS, AND

00:04:19.985 --> 00:04:21.986
INCREASINGLY DEMONIZE THOSE THAT

00:04:21.987 --> 00:04:24.322
TAKE A DIFFERENT POINT OF VIEW,

00:04:24.323 --> 00:04:25.623
AND YOU ARE RIGHT, THE

00:04:25.624 --> 00:04:26.557
INTERNATIONAL CRIMINAL COURT.

00:04:26.558 --> 00:04:28.126
AREAS LIKE THAT CAN START TO

00:04:28.127 --> 00:04:30.762
MAKE JUDGMENTS IN THESE AREAS

00:04:30.763 --> 00:04:33.164
THAT WILL, YOU'RE QUITE RIGHT,

00:04:33.165 --> 00:04:36.367
BE REFERENCED BY NATIONAL

00:04:36.368 --> 00:04:36.934
COURTS.

00:04:36.935 --> 00:04:38.436
&gt;&gt; Laura: THEY MARGINALIZE

00:04:38.437 --> 00:04:38.770
VOICES.

00:04:38.771 --> 00:04:40.471
YOU SEE THIS HAPPEN ON SOCIAL

00:04:40.472 --> 00:04:42.974
MEDIA, ON TWITTER, FACEBOOK,

00:04:42.975 --> 00:04:45.610
YOUTUBE CHANNELS, THEY'RE MAKING

00:04:45.611 --> 00:04:47.045
JUDGMENT CALLS ON WHO AND WHO IS

00:04:47.046 --> 00:04:51.682
NOT PART OF THE ACCEPTABLE CLUB,

00:04:51.683 --> 00:04:54.185
NIGEL, THE GRAND DAMME OF

00:04:54.186 --> 00:04:56.921
MIGRATION, ANGELA MERKEL FROM A

00:04:56.922 --> 00:04:58.122
WEEK AND A HALF AGO OR SO.

00:04:58.123 --> 00:05:00.925
LET'S WATCH.

00:05:00.926 --> 00:05:05.197
[SPEAKING IN FOREIGN LANGUAGE]

00:05:12.704 --> 00:05:15.039
&gt;&gt; Laura: YOU'RE ON SATELLITE.

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:16.841
UNLESS YOUR GERMAN REALLY GOOD

00:05:16.842 --> 00:05:19.210
IT'S BASICALLY THIS IS A RIGHT.

00:05:19.211 --> 00:05:20.945
WE HAVE TO STAND UP FOR THE

00:05:20.946 --> 00:05:21.946
RIGHT OF REFUGEES.

00:05:21.947 --> 00:05:24.148
I BELIEVE IN STANDING UP FOR

00:05:24.149 --> 00:05:25.183
REFUGEES BUT IT DOESN'T MEAN

00:05:25.184 --> 00:05:27.285
THAT EVERY COUNTRY'S BORDER HAS

00:05:27.286 --> 00:05:30.721
TO REMAIN OPEN IF A GLOBAL

00:05:30.722 --> 00:05:32.723
ENTITY LIKE THE U.N. SAYS, "OK,

00:05:32.724 --> 00:05:34.525
YOU'VE GOT TO DO IT" WHETHER

00:05:34.526 --> 00:05:37.061
IT'S TO THE 7,000 PEOPLE IN

00:05:37.062 --> 00:05:38.429
TIJUANA OR ANY OTHER GROUP.

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:41.332
&gt;&gt; LET'S REMEMBER WHAT A REFUGEE

00:05:41.333 --> 00:05:41.732
IS.

00:05:41.733 --> 00:05:43.601
1951 DEFINITION OF WHAT A

00:05:43.602 --> 00:05:45.369
REFUGEE IS AND IT'S A PERSON IN

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:46.871
FEAR OF THEIR LIFE OR THEIR

00:05:46.872 --> 00:05:48.306
LIBERTY AS A RESULT OF THEIR

00:05:48.307 --> 00:05:50.308
RACE, THEIR RELIGION, THEIR

00:05:50.309 --> 00:05:52.443
VIEWS, THEIR ORIENTATION.

00:05:52.444 --> 00:05:54.345
THAT DOES NOT MEAN THAT MILLIONS

00:05:54.346 --> 00:05:57.682
OF PEOPLE THAT HAVE CROSSED THE

00:05:57.683 --> 00:05:58.416
MEDITERRANEAN OVER THE LAST

00:05:58.417 --> 00:06:00.351
COUPLE OF YEARS ENCOURAGED BY

00:06:00.352 --> 00:06:01.853
ANGELA MERKEL WERE REFUGEES.

00:06:01.854 --> 00:06:03.187
THEY WEREN'T.

00:06:03.188 --> 00:06:05.022
THEY WERE ECONOMIC MIGRANTS

00:06:05.023 --> 00:06:06.424
COMING FROM ALL OVER THE WORLD

00:06:06.425 --> 00:06:11.662
USING THE OPPORTUNITY OF THE

00:06:11.663 --> 00:06:14.132
HUGE STUPIDITY MADE BY ANGELA

00:06:14.133 --> 00:06:16.167
MERKEL, I GENUINELY BELIEVE THAT

00:06:16.168 --> 00:06:17.835
CHRISTIANS LIVING IN IRAQ AND

00:06:17.836 --> 00:06:19.403
COUNTRIES LIKE THAT WHO HAVE

00:06:19.404 --> 00:06:21.005
LITERALLY GOT NOWHERE TO GO,

00:06:21.006 --> 00:06:22.607
THEY QUALIFY AS GENUINE

00:06:22.608 --> 00:06:23.908
REFUGEES, BUT YOU CANNOT OPEN

00:06:23.909 --> 00:06:26.544
THE DOOR TO MASS MILLIONS, AND

00:06:26.545 --> 00:06:28.646
SUDDENLY PRETEND THAT'S OK, AND

00:06:28.647 --> 00:06:29.847
THIS IS EXACTLY WHAT THE U.N.

00:06:29.848 --> 00:06:31.649
ARE TRYING TO DO NEXT WEEK.

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:33.351
THEY'RE TRYING TO BAIL OUT

00:06:33.352 --> 00:06:35.052
ANGELA MERKEL AND THE OTHER

00:06:35.053 --> 00:06:36.420
POLITICIANS WHO HAVE MADE THESE

00:06:36.421 --> 00:06:38.222
HUGE MISTAKES AND I WOULD HAVE

00:06:38.223 --> 00:06:40.158
THOUGHT WHAT MRS. MERKEL OUGHT

00:06:40.159 --> 00:06:41.726
TO DO RATHER THAN DEFENDING HER

00:06:41.727 --> 00:06:44.428
JUDGMENT IS TO APOLOGIZE TO

00:06:44.429 --> 00:06:46.564
MILLIONS OF GERMAN PEOPLE FOR

00:06:46.565 --> 00:06:47.965
FUNDAMENTALLY CHANGING THE

00:06:47.966 --> 00:06:50.034
NATURE OF A CULTURE OF THE TOWNS

00:06:50.035 --> 00:06:53.104
AND CITIES IN WHICH PEOPLE LIVE

00:06:53.105 --> 00:06:56.240
WITHOUT EVER ASKING THE PEOPLE.

00:06:56.241 --> 00:07:00.211
&gt;&gt; Laura: SWEDEN IS SEEING ITS

00:07:00.212 --> 00:07:00.945
POPULIST MOVEMENT.

00:07:00.946 --> 00:07:10.521
WE SAW THE LAST ELECTION.

00:07:10.522 --> 00:07:12.290
ANDALUSIA.

00:07:12.291 --> 00:07:12.991
MACRON.

